assets/*.bin
# ...except bootloader.bin/partitions.bin themselves -- 2026-09-19: these
# only change if the partition table or SDK/bootloader config changes
# (not on every app rebuild), and requiring every bench machine to have
# PlatformIO installed just to produce these two small, stable files was
# real friction on a fresh Windows setup. Committed so `git pull` alone
# is enough; the app binary itself still always comes from the backend
# per-build, unaffected by this.
!assets/bootloader.bin
!assets/partitions.bin
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
